{"key":"13e34367cac1baff01da2980c6b514c636d4d47e0dcfc9c8a12261f390fd452c","quote":"Reply within the same minute.","text":"{\"limits\": [{\"limit\": 1, \"comparison\": \"le\", \"role\": \"constraint\", \"unit\": \"minutes\"}]}","usage":{"input":627,"output":44}}
