{"key":"a6c42dfc3d483cd8699424cff9a542a1a48182386e3b1f16d3c615497068b398","quote":"When the guest wants to book, ask for the name, dates and number of guests before anything else.","text":"{\"limits\": []}","usage":{"input":643,"output":9}}
